WEBVTT

00:12:00.116 --> 00:12:01.956
And when I sat on that hillside,

00:12:01.956 --> 00:12:04.156
and I saw the pigs rootling

00:12:04.156 --> 00:12:05.316
and the trees growing

00:12:05.316 --> 00:12:08.356
and the machines
getting ready to cook and grind,

00:12:08.356 --> 00:12:11.236
I loved it ...

00:12:11.236 --> 00:12:13.476
because I experienced an emotion

00:12:13.476 --> 00:12:16.116
that those of us who work
on climate change

00:12:16.116 --> 00:12:18.436
very rarely experience.

00:12:19.276 --> 00:12:21.556
I felt hope.

00:12:22.916 --> 00:12:23.916
Thank you.

00:12:23.916 --> 00:12:30.276
(Applause and cheers)